# Build & run commands

Use scripts in [`scripts/`](../scripts/) or invoke slash skills (`/dev-android`, `/build-ios-prod`, etc.).

| Dev | Prod (signed release) |
|-----|------------------------|
| `./scripts/dev_android.sh` | `./scripts/build_android_prod.sh` (needs `android/key.properties`) |
| `./scripts/dev_ios.sh` | `./scripts/build_ios_prod.sh` |
| `./scripts/dev_web.sh` | `./scripts/build_web_prod.sh` |
| `./scripts/dev_macos.sh` | `./scripts/build_macos_prod.sh` |

Full index: `partner-check-builds` skill. Before release builds, run `flutter analyze` per `flutter-verify` skill.
